{"beat": 37, "name": "THE FULFILMENT FEE", "text": "If you sell on Amazon and use its fulfilment, you pay a different card, built the same way. The fulfilment fee for a standard-size item climbs in steps of weight. For a large standard item priced from $10 to $50, the non-peak card that took effect January 15, 2026 charges $4.20 from 8 ounces up to 12 ounces. Over 12 ounces, $4.60. One step: $0.40, on every unit, before the fuel and logistics surcharge of 3.5% that's added to every fulfilment fee. And from October 15, a peak card raises the steps for the holidays. Your customer never sees this card. You pay it. And unlike the farmer, I'd bet most sellers have never laid their products against it.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "If", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.12}, {"word": "you", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.24}, {"word": "sell", "start": 0.24, "end": 0.46}, {"word": "on", "start": 0.46, "end": 0.62}, {"word": "Amazon", "start": 0.62, "end": 1.1}, {"word": "and", "start": 1.1, "end": 1.6}, {"word": "use", "start": 1.6, "end": 1.84}, {"word": "its", "start": 1.84, "end": 2.0}, {"word": "fulfilment,", "start": 2.0, "end": 2.48}, {"word": "you", "start": 3.02, "end": 3.18}, {"word": "pay", "start": 3.18, "end": 3.38}, {"word": "a", "start": 3.38, "end": 3.54}, {"word": "different", "start": 3.54, "end": 3.72}, {"word": "card,", "start": 3.72, "end": 4.12}, {"word": "built", "start": 4.12, "end": 4.7}, {"word": "the", "start": 4.7, "end": 4.92}, {"word": "same", "start": 4.92, "end": 5.22}, {"word": "way.", "start": 5.22, "end": 5.5}, {"word": "The", "start": 6.12, "end": 6.24}, {"word": "fulfilment", "start": 6.24, "end": 6.68}, {"word": "fee", "start": 6.68, "end": 7.04}, {"word": "for", "start": 7.04, "end": 7.26}, {"word": "a", "start": 7.26, "end": 7.4}, {"word": "standard-size", "start": 7.4, "end": 8.08}, {"word": "item", "start": 8.08, "end": 8.54}, {"word": "climbs", "start": 8.54, "end": 8.9}, {"word": "in", "start": 8.9, "end": 9.18}, {"word": "steps"